36
00:01:42.980 --> 00:01:46.700
People weren't as totally familiar with jinx or the rule of jinx.

37
00:01:46.900 --> 00:01:53.100
It's a kid game where if you say something at the same time as someone, you just say jinx, and then the person can't talk.

38
00:01:53.280 --> 00:01:54.480
Now, my kids play it.

39
00:01:54.560 --> 00:01:59.740
