77
00:03:32.580 --> 00:03:34.880
I feel like I need to give some context to that.

78
00:03:35.540 --> 00:03:36.800
That is a huge amount.

79
00:03:37.000 --> 00:03:37.960
That's so much.

80
00:03:37.960 --> 00:03:43.980
So every page of a script generally equals one minute of screen time.

81
00:03:44.220 --> 00:03:51.420
So if a script is 120 pages, that movie will come in around 120 minutes.

82
00:03:51.420 --> 00:03:57.120
And so our scripts were usually around 35, 40 pages.

83
00:03:57.160 --> 00:03:58.540
They'd have to trim that.

84
00:03:58.840 --> 00:04:00.320
Down to 22 minutes.

85
00:04:01.920 --> 00:04:05.720
Imagine if you shot, like, we were shoot, we shot, like, what is that?

86
00:04:05.840 --> 00:04:08.100
Like, 25, 30 percent.

