90
00:04:12.880 --> 00:04:14.140
That was a marathon day.

91
00:04:14.260 --> 00:04:15.080
Marathon day.

92
00:04:15.080 --> 00:04:19.840
Well, I wrote in my journal that this was our last episode of the season, and we were

