00:07:32.240 --> 00:07:33.700
All right, Fast Fact number two.

163
00:07:34.200 --> 00:07:38.520
Speaking of Dwight's uniform, we got a lot of questions about that.

164
00:07:38.820 --> 00:07:41.100
So, fan question from Bailey Lawson.

165
00:07:41.300 --> 00:07:45.860
Was Dwight's volunteer uniform copied from the actual Scranton uniforms?

166
00:07:46.700 --> 00:07:48.200
I went to Kentopedia.

167
00:07:48.540 --> 00:07:48.940
Good.

168
00:07:48.940 --> 00:07:54.400
And he said that the sheriff's costume was authentic to Pennsylvania, that Carrie Bennett,

169
00:07:55.260 --> 00:08:01.140
our wardrobe designer, she had done a lot of research on it, but they did take some liberties.

170
00:08:01.720 --> 00:08:07.960
The hat and the boots, those were generally worn by the Pennsylvania state troopers.

171
00:08:08.240 --> 00:08:10.720
The Pennsylvania sheriffs wore different hat and shoes.

172
00:08:11.140 --> 00:08:13.140
But we thought, I don't know.

173
00:08:13.140 --> 00:08:14.420
I wanted to give Dwight that power.

174
00:08:14.600 --> 00:08:17.720
In the DVD commentary, Jen talks about her love of this hat.

175
00:08:18.060 --> 00:08:22.460
She loved him in this hat so much, her and Greg both did, that they kept wanting him to wear it.

176
00:08:22.540 --> 00:08:27.060
So, you'll see in the episode, there'll be scenes without him in the hat and scenes with him in the hat.

177
00:08:27.260 --> 00:08:32.300
And then they also told hair and makeup when he would take the hat off, they would go try to fix his hair.

178
00:08:32.400 --> 00:08:33.180
And they were like, no, no, no.

179
00:08:33.340 --> 00:08:34.880
He needs to look like he has hat head.

180
00:08:35.080 --> 00:08:35.340
Yeah.

181
00:08:35.340 --> 00:08:41.720
So, if you look at Dwight's hair in this, it's kind of smushed down because they wanted it to look like he had just taken his hat off.

182
00:08:41.880 --> 00:08:44.380
I think that's, I love that detail about our show.

183
00:08:44.520 --> 00:08:45.140
I do too.

184
00:08:45.340 --> 00:08:52.940
And Rain in the DVD commentary said he noticed a difference in how the ladies acted around him this week in this uniform.

185
00:08:53.420 --> 00:08:56.660
He said all the ladies acted a little differently.

186
00:08:57.080 --> 00:08:57.300
Huh.

187
00:08:57.680 --> 00:09:01.300
Well, we'll have to get him in here to give us more details on that.

188
00:09:01.300 --> 00:09:02.460
All right.

