00:09:21.860 --> 00:09:24.040
Well, I got this letter.

200
00:09:24.540 --> 00:09:25.940
I jinxed M33.

201
00:09:26.460 --> 00:09:26.700
Okay.

202
00:09:26.920 --> 00:09:27.680
Wrote in to say,

203
00:09:27.680 --> 00:09:32.980
trivia, there was a character on Young and the Restless named Michael Scott.

204
00:09:33.680 --> 00:09:37.000
He was locked in the basement by Victor Newman.

205
00:09:37.260 --> 00:09:39.000
Oh, Victor Newman was so evil.

206
00:09:39.300 --> 00:09:40.800
So, I looked it up.

207
00:09:40.840 --> 00:09:45.980
And yes, from 1981 to 82, there was this character named Michael Scott.

208
00:09:46.160 --> 00:09:48.260
He was played by actor Nicholas Benedict.

209
00:09:48.800 --> 00:09:55.420
So, Michael Scott was a photographer and he had an affair with Victor's first wife, Julia.

210
00:09:55.420 --> 00:09:57.900
And so, Victor locked him in a basement?

211
00:09:58.100 --> 00:09:58.280
Yeah.

212
00:09:58.600 --> 00:10:02.800
He locked him in his bomb shelter, which was in the basement?

213
00:10:03.000 --> 00:10:04.700
Victor was a very wealthy man.

214
00:10:05.020 --> 00:10:06.720
He probably had a whole bunker.

215
00:10:06.980 --> 00:10:08.260
Well, listen to what he did, though.

216
00:10:08.420 --> 00:10:10.180
Why do I know all this about Young and the Restless?

217
00:10:10.360 --> 00:10:10.600
Okay, go.

218
00:10:10.600 --> 00:10:11.220
Did you watch it?

219
00:10:11.220 --> 00:10:14.340
My grandmother did her stories, but she wouldn't admit to it.

220
00:10:14.560 --> 00:10:14.920
Oh, that's right.

221
00:10:14.920 --> 00:10:17.640
She'd say, I don't even care anything about that.

222
00:10:17.680 --> 00:10:19.120
But she'd leave it on all day.

223
00:10:19.220 --> 00:10:21.480
And her stories would be playing in the background.

224
00:10:21.480 --> 00:10:23.560
So, I watched all my children.

225
00:10:24.360 --> 00:10:27.380
My mom watched all my children when she nursed me.

226
00:10:27.720 --> 00:10:34.360
And then she said that's how she got into it, was that it was on when it was time to nurse me as a baby.

227
00:10:34.540 --> 00:10:35.860
And then she watched it.

228
00:10:35.940 --> 00:10:38.220
I kind of grew up watching it with her, right?

229
00:10:38.220 --> 00:10:46.960
And then when I went to college, I arranged my class schedule so that I could be home to watch all my children.

230
00:10:47.460 --> 00:10:49.020
Because it was on at noon.

231
00:10:49.020 --> 00:10:50.000
It was on ABC.

232
00:10:50.540 --> 00:10:52.220
Kelly Ripa was on it, by the way.

233
00:10:52.360 --> 00:10:52.660
Oh, yeah.

234
00:10:52.960 --> 00:10:56.040
And, you know, we didn't have what we have now.

235
00:10:56.160 --> 00:10:58.420
We didn't have this, like, digital recording stuff.

236
00:10:58.720 --> 00:11:00.360
If you missed it, you missed it.

237
00:11:00.380 --> 00:11:00.780
You missed it.

238
00:11:00.900 --> 00:11:04.500
Well, listen to what Victor Newman did to poor Michael Scott in the basement.

239
00:11:04.740 --> 00:11:05.520
Oh, no, Victor.

240
00:11:05.520 --> 00:11:08.000
He fed him baked rats.

241
00:11:08.460 --> 00:11:09.460
Ew, Victor.

242
00:11:10.060 --> 00:11:10.440
Yeah.

243
00:11:10.780 --> 00:11:17.400
He also put in, like, a live video feed so that Michael Scott had to watch Victor make love to Julia.

244
00:11:18.200 --> 00:11:20.200
Wow, that is twisted.

245
00:11:20.560 --> 00:11:20.840
Yeah.

246
00:11:21.140 --> 00:11:23.620
I want to be in the writer's room at Young and the Restless.

247
00:11:23.840 --> 00:11:27.160
I want to see what's on their cards on the wall.

248
00:11:27.620 --> 00:11:28.100
Yeah.

249
00:11:28.440 --> 00:11:30.400
Michael Scott in basement.

250
00:11:31.480 --> 00:11:35.020
Well, eventually Julia discovered what was going on.

251
00:11:35.020 --> 00:11:36.000
